WEBVTT

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:05.210
Around 1,800 years ago,

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:08.460
China was divided into three regions
that were in a struggle for supremacy:

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:10.540
Liu Bei–led Shu,

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:10.540
<b>SHU</b>

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:12.080
Cao Cao–led Wei,

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:12.080
<b>WEI</b>

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:12.080
<b>SHU</b>

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:17.580
<b>WEI</b>

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:17.580
<b>WU</b>

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:13.580
and Sun Quan–led Wu.

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:17.580
<b>SHU</b>

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:15.750
That is to say, it was the Three Kingdoms period.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:18.290
In the Three Kingdoms period
where these three giants faced off,

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:20.250
heroic figures were forged

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:23.330
whose stories have been handed down to this day.

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:27.250
In 234 CE on the Wuzhang Plains,

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:35.920
<b>Wuzhang Plains</b>

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:29.670
the Shu camp was quietly reeling.

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:32.290
Shu Emperor Liu Bei was already dead,

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:35.540
and Sima Yi's Wei camp was staring them down.

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:40.330
Amid this, Shu's chancellor, Zhuge Kongming,
was being ravaged by an illness.

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:41.630
Chancellor!

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:43.750
Chancellor! Hang in there!

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:49.750
<i>We will lose this battle.</i>

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:57.290
<i>I have lost many comrades and
vanquished a multitude of foes.</i>

00:00:58.670 --> 00:01:01.540
<i>I am not long for this world.</i>

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:04.170
<i>I hope...</i>

00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:05.170
Chancellor?

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:06.420
Chancellor!

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:08.460
<i>...that my next life...</i>

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:11.880
<i>...doesn't revolve around war.</i>

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:14.880
<b>234 CE</b>

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:14.880
<b>Zhuge Kongming dies</b>

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:17.130
<i>I dearly wish to be reborn in a peaceful world.</i>

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:23.960
<b><i>ya Boy KONGMING!</i></b>

00:01:26.170 --> 00:01:28.380
<b>Chance x Chance, Rendezvous!! Chiki chiki ban</b>

00:01:26.170 --> 00:01:28.380
<b>Chan x Chan, Ai!! Chiki chiki ban</b>

00:01:52.790 --> 00:01:54.000
Where am I?

00:01:57.500 --> 00:01:59.630
Didn't I die?

00:02:11.460 --> 00:02:14.380
<i>Ah, of course, now I see.</i>

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:17.380
<i>This must be Hell.</i>

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:20.080
Happy Halloween!

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:20.540
<b>Kongming Descends Upon Shibuya</b>

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:22.830
Kongming?!

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:23.540
Yes?

00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:25.130
You must be Kongming, right?

00:02:25.130 --> 00:02:28.670
Indeed, I am Zhuge Liang, courtesy name Kongming.

00:02:28.670 --> 00:02:29.540
Damn, dude!
Indeed, I am Zhuge Liang, courtesy name Kongming.<b></b>

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:30.830
You're super in character!

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:32.000
Kongming? Who's that?

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:35.080
Ya know, that military strategist with a 100 million IQ?

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:36.670
One hundred million IQ! Yeah!

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:38.880
<i>Are these two minions of Hell?
</i>Talk about high quality!<b></b>

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:40.170
Have your fill!

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:42.170
C'mon, drink! Bottoms up!

00:02:42.170 --> 00:02:43.250
<i>Is this...</i>

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:45.500
<i>It feels like my throat is on fire!</i>

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:46.710
<i>Hell's punishment!</i>

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:48.000
Nice drinkin', man.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:49.750
It's top-shelf tequila.

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:51.880
This, too, must be one of Hell's torments.

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:53.210
There is no fighting it.

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:54.630
I think I like ya, Kongming.

00:02:54.630 --> 00:02:56.000
Let's hit the club, c'mon!

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:57.880
The next realm of Hell?

00:02:57.880 --> 00:02:59.080
Very well.

00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:01.290
I am resigned to accepting my punishment.

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:02.380
Yeah!

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:08.580
<i>Nevertheless, the afterlife sure is bothersomely noisy.</i>

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:10.500
<b>REGARDING YOUR AUDITION</b>

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:10.500
<b>A_Vex Auditions Manager - Maemura</b>

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:10.500
<b>Ms. Eiko Tsukimi</b>

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:10.500
<b>This is Maemura,</b>

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:10.500
<b>the auditions manager at A_Vex.</b>

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:10.500
<b>Thank you for auditioning the other day.</b>

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.420
<b>Upon consideration by our team,</b>

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.420
<b>I regret to inform you that</b>

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.420
<b>we will not be going forward</b>

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.420
<b>with your application.</b>

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.420
<b>I am sorry, but I ask</b>

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.420
<b>for your understanding.</b>

00:03:10.510 --> 00:03:12.420
<b>Thank you again for auditioning.</b>

00:03:10.510 --> 00:03:12.420
<b>I wish you all the best.</b>

00:03:10.510 --> 00:03:12.420
<b>Maemura</b>

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:16.170
Another rejection...

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:25.630
We brought Kongming with us!

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:26.540
Wow!

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:27.540
He's totally Kongming!

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:28.960
<i>Th-this earsplitting din...</i>

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:34.460
<i>I may be dead in body, but it still stings to my core.</i>

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:37.500
<i>Where is this sound coming from?</i>

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:43.420
<b>Be crazy for me</b>

00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:45.710
<b>Make me shine on you</b>

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:46.830
<b>You're gonna see me</b>

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:49.250
<b>When you hear my music</b>

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:50.960
<b>I'll be there for you</b>

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:52.710
<b>No matter where you go</b>

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:55.880
<b>How do you see me from your point of view</b>

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:58.130
<b>I steal your heart</b>

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:01.670
<b>I'll take you higher</b>

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:02.380
<i>A songstress of Hell?</i>

00:04:02.460 --> 00:04:04.630
<b>Are you crazy for me?</b>

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:05.250
<i>What splendid music.</i>

00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:08.710
<i>The sound washes over me</i>

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:08.540
<b>I'll take you higher</b>

00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:11.170
<i>like the turbid waters of the Yangtze River.</i>

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:11.170
<b>Are you crazy for me?</b>

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:16.920
Nobody even listened to my song.

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:19.790
Maybe I just don't have talent.

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:21.500
Oh, that's not true.

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:22.710
You're trying your best.

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:26.630
Talent isn't something you get by trying your best.

00:04:28.130 --> 00:04:29.330
Excuse me...

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:30.540
Yes?

00:04:32.130 --> 00:04:33.880
You talking to me?

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:38.460
I was greatly impressed by your beautiful singing voice.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:41.710
Thank you.

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:44.130
To think that a songstress of Hell
would be so magnificent...

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:45.330
Hell?

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:48.920
Come! I would like you to guide me further into Hell.

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:53.750
I desire to command a corpse army and
engage in battle with the spirits of the war dead!

00:04:54.830 --> 00:04:56.540
Can I get some help over here?

00:04:56.540 --> 00:04:57.880
Okay, coming!

00:04:57.880 --> 00:04:59.880
Well, uh, take care not to drink too much.

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:05.460
Hell...

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:07.540
Perhaps it is not all so bad.

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:09.130
Found ya, Kongming!

00:05:09.130 --> 00:05:10.380
Where'd you go?

00:05:10.380 --> 00:05:11.580
Looks like ya need more booze!

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:13.130
More torments of Hell...

00:05:13.130 --> 00:05:14.380
I shall take up that challenge.

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:15.080
Yeah, yeah!

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:16.330
What's with that guy?

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:17.540
There was someone.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:20.460
Somebody who listened to your song.

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:23.130
Got it.

00:05:26.460 --> 00:05:27.670
Well, see you.

00:05:28.130 --> 00:05:29.790
Goodbye!

00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:32.170
Brrr...

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:54.830
Hey, it's morning; wake up.

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:57.540
Sima Yi, you fiend...

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:00.330
Hey...

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:05.500
What a wonderful singing voice...

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:10.880
Aw, guess I've gotta do it...

00:06:11.420 --> 00:06:14.710
<b>Everything seemed to be alright</b>

00:06:16.330 --> 00:06:20.580
<b>Cause you gave me whisphers of love all night</b>

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:32.130
Oh, you're up.

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:34.880
That voice... Is that you, Songstress of Hell?

00:06:34.880 --> 00:06:36.710
Did you bring me to this place?

00:06:36.710 --> 00:06:40.460
Who you callin' "Songstress of Hell"?
I saved your life, you know.

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:43.290
You would've frozen to death
sleeping in the street like that.

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:46.130
The idea of freezing to death in Hell...

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:49.040
What're you on about?
Clearly, this ain't Hell.

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:50.380
This isn't Hell?

00:06:51.170 --> 00:06:53.000
Where in the world am I, then?

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.000
What now?

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:00.670
This is how I looked when I was young.

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:02.500
What sorcery is this?

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:04.210
It's just a plain old mirror.

00:07:04.210 --> 00:07:05.380
A mirror?

00:07:05.380 --> 00:07:07.880
This object that is as clear as water?

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:10.080
If, by chance...

00:07:10.080 --> 00:07:11.290
No, it can't be...

00:07:12.460 --> 00:07:16.460
<b>SHU</b>

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:14.080
<i>Ridiculous...</i>

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:16.460
<i>Surely, I died on the Wuzhang Plains.</i>

00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:20.380
<i>Even the Qimen Dunjia had nothing to say
about reincarnation techniques.</i>

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:23.380
<i>However, it is a fact I have been restored to life.</i>

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:25.290
<i>This heartbeat is genuine.</i>

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:28.040
If you've sobered up, I'd appreciate it if you head home.

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:32.330
Hey, you're not gettin' any funny ideas, are ya?

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:35.500
Please excuse me.
I just got to thinking is all.

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:37.580
Would it not be good fun to use my intellect

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:42.080
to aim to unify the land for the sake of its people
in today's world as well?

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:44.580
I forgot to introduce myself:

00:07:45.130 --> 00:07:49.960
I am Zhuge Liang, courtesy name Kongming.

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:52.750
I'm Eiko Tsukimi.

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:54.080
You can call me Eiko.

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:57.460
So the songstress goes by the name of Eiko.

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:02.080
More importantly, it seems you don't have
a wallet or smartphone on you.

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:03.960
You gonna be alright?
Can you get home?

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:05.670
Hm? What is a "smartphone"?

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:07.920
What? You a flip phone user or something?

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:09.630
This here!

00:08:11.210 --> 00:08:13.540
What kind of book is this?

00:08:13.540 --> 00:08:15.210
Words appear only to disappear again.

00:08:15.210 --> 00:08:18.130
For there to be such detailed pictures
on such a small object...

00:08:18.130 --> 00:08:19.330
You some kinda geezer?!

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:21.170
Just drink some water and calm down.

00:08:21.170 --> 00:08:22.920
This material is like that of a cicada's husk!

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:23.960
It's a plastic bottle!

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:27.540
Eiko! What does the movement of the
long and short pointers signify?!

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:28.540
It's a clock!

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:31.130
Eiko! There is water boiling!
We must put out the fire!

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:32.130
It's a humidifier!

00:08:32.130 --> 00:08:32.540
Eiko!

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:33.130
Air conditioner!
Eiko!<b></b>

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:33.630
Air conditioner!
Eiko!

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:34.330
Computer!
Eiko!<b></b>

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:36.540
Heiko, vut is dis?

00:08:36.540 --> 00:08:39.330
Sorry, I don't actually know either...

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:41.670
Goodness me.

00:08:41.670 --> 00:08:45.330
There are so many things in this world
of which I am ignorant.

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:47.130
What is it you DO know about?

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:51.210
Will you be so kind as to as at least teach me
to use this smartphone?

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:53.170
No way! What a pain!

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:56.880
Talent is not something with which one is born.

00:08:57.170 --> 00:09:00.330
I believe that it is developed through learning.

00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:06.290
Should I gain wisdom,
it is my intention to use it for your benefit.

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:09.500
All right, fine.

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:11.670
Until I leave for work, anyway.

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:15.460
And what, pray tell, is the blockchain?

00:09:15.460 --> 00:09:16.750
Enough already!

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:19.250
Question after question for four hours!
Just who are you?!

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:22.130
Zhuge Kongming, as I said.
I even have a Wiki page.

00:09:22.130 --> 00:09:24.540
How long you gonna keep up that act?!

00:09:25.670 --> 00:09:26.750
What's your deal?

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:29.330
Kongming is some Chinese historical figure, right?!

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:31.080
You speak Japanese fluently!

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:32.580
What's with that?

00:09:32.580 --> 00:09:33.790
Good point.

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:37.540
I found myself naturally speaking Japanese
without realizing it.

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:44.750
<b>Zhuge Liang</b>

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:44.750
<b>July 219 CE - Lui Bei became King of Hanzhong.</b>

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:44.750
<b>January 220 CE - Cao Cao died.</b>

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:44.750
<b>The following year, Liu Bei</b>

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:44.750
<b>ascended to the throne in</b>

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:40.330
I can also comprehend these characters

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:44.750
<b>Chengdu and established Shu Han,</b>

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:44.750
<b>and Kongming became chancellor.</b>

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:42.420
as though I've known them since my past life.

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:44.750
It's as though I have been readied for this life.

00:09:44.920 --> 00:09:47.830
According to this Wiki page,
you've been dead a long time.

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:52.130
Indeed, which is why it seems I have been
sent to this era for some reason.

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:53.250
Get real!

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:56.460
Yellow Turban Rebellion, Battle of Guandu,
Battle of Red Cliffs...

00:09:56.460 --> 00:09:59.210
So this is how they've been passed down in later ages.

00:09:59.210 --> 00:10:00.290
Yeah, yeah.

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:02.500
Well, I've got work, so I'm gonna wash my face.

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:07.040
The year 216 CE: Cao Cao became King of Wei.

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:10.290
The year 219 CE: Lui Bei became King of Hanzhong.

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:12.460
It really takes me back.

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:16.790
November 263 CE...

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:20.250
<b>Sometime in 256 CE - Jiang Wei was routed</b>

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:20.250
<b>at the Battle of Duan Valley</b>

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:20.250
<b>by Deng Ai, sapping the</b>

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:20.250
<b>strength of Shu Han.</b>

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:20.250
<b>November 263 CE - Shu Han fell.</b>

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:20.250
<b>March 264 CE - Sima Zhao became King of Jin.</b>

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:20.250
<b>August 265 - Sima Zhao died and Sima Yan</b>

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:20.250
<b>became King of Jin.</b>

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:29.250
<i>So, Shu ended up falling, after all.</i>

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:36.330
<i>After that, the Sima clan unified the country,</i>

00:10:36.330 --> 00:10:39.710
<i>but alas that did not last long before
devolving into another turbulent period.</i>

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:42.540
<i>Now, 1,800 years later...</i>

00:10:43.710 --> 00:10:47.380
<i>there is no longer a single face I recognize.</i>

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:52.580
What's wrong, Kongming?

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:56.080
Oh, it's nothing.

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:18.460
Two, three...

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:33.670
<b>Everything seemed to be alright</b>

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:39.710
<b>Cause you gave me whispers of love all night</b>

00:11:42.210 --> 00:11:45.330
<b>But I'm alone tonight</b>

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:51.040
<b>And I don't know how to stop heaving sighs</b>

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:55.420
<b>I just wanna get you out of my mind</b>

00:11:55.420 --> 00:11:58.040
<b>You don't know how much I love you</b>

00:11:56.830 --> 00:11:58.040
<i>This must be...</i>

00:11:58.330 --> 00:12:02.080
<i>a love song about someone who is held dear.</i>

00:11:58.710 --> 00:12:02.540
<b>But you don't wanna be with me any more</b>

00:12:02.830 --> 00:12:04.040
Kongming...

00:12:02.830 --> 00:12:05.880
<b>I'm still alive today</b>

00:12:04.830 --> 00:12:06.040
Kongming...

00:12:05.880 --> 00:12:08.670
<b>You are so far away</b>

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:08.750
Peace and tranquility!

00:12:08.670 --> 00:12:14.170
<b>Even though you have broken my heart, baby</b>

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:11.290
Let us create a world without war!

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:17.210
<b>I'm still alive today</b>

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:20.130
<b>And miss you all day</b>

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:26.080
<b>I just thought I could live without you</b>

00:12:26.630 --> 00:12:30.630
<b>Now I don't know what to do with myself</b>

00:12:31.580 --> 00:12:41.420
<b>Maybe I'm stronger than I think and I'm still in love</b>

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:47.290
Your singing has the power to energize people.

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:49.130
Really?

00:12:49.130 --> 00:12:51.040
I'm still just an amateur, though.

00:12:51.460 --> 00:12:53.210
What is an "amateur"?

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:56.000
Kind of a like an apprentice?

00:12:56.000 --> 00:13:02.580
Nevertheless, the other music at the club last night
sounded like dreadful noise to my ears.

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:04.500
No way! The crowd was pumped!

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:05.750
You're so lame, Kongming!

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:09.380
Grasping the current trends is key. Look!

00:13:09.380 --> 00:13:11.670
I'm hearing an inscrutable tootle.

00:13:11.670 --> 00:13:12.880
Is that a flute?

00:13:12.880 --> 00:13:14.290
It's EDM!

00:13:14.290 --> 00:13:16.670
The singer is quite good, anyway.

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:17.880
Right?!

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:24.710
Eiko, I have taken a keen interest
in the music of this era.

00:13:24.710 --> 00:13:28.170
However, I am still ignorant of the ways of this world.

00:13:28.170 --> 00:13:30.920
I would like to broaden my knowledge.

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:32.460
Yeah! Now you're talking!

00:13:32.460 --> 00:13:34.580
I just know you'll get hooked on music!

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:36.000
Such being the case...

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:38.460
...in order to procure a war chest,

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:40.790
I ask for your help in finding employment.

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:42.000
You're unemployed?!

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:44.580
Ya Boy Kongming!

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:43.130
<b><i>ya</i></b>

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:43.670
<b><i>ya Boy</i></b>

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:43.880
<b><i>ya Boy KONG</i></b>

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:46.000
<b><i>ya Boy KONGMING!</i></b>

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:49.960
<b>Résumé</b>

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:49.960
<b>Name               Zhuge Kongming</b>

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:49.960
<b>Date of Birth     April 14, 181 CE</b>

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:49.960
<b>Address</b>

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:49.960
<b>231-2 Wuhou District, Chengdu, Sichuan</b>

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:49.960
<b>Phone</b>

00:13:48.750 --> 00:13:49.960
You?

00:13:50.250 --> 00:13:53.330
Tryin' to play yourself off as Kongming, huh, punk?

00:13:53.670 --> 00:13:55.170
Go on, introduce yourself!

00:13:55.170 --> 00:13:56.460
With your REAL name.

00:13:56.750 --> 00:13:59.130
I am Zhuge Liang, courtesy name Kongming.

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:00.960
No, not your alter ego!
I am Zhuge Liang, courtesy name Kongming.<b></b>

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:02.880
Owner, just calm down!

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:04.710
If you're really Kongming...

00:14:05.210 --> 00:14:07.920
then why'd you send Ma Su to Jieting?

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:10.500
"Ma-su"? What's that?

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:11.500
Muscle?

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:14.630
Ma Su was a favored apprentice of Kongming's.

00:14:14.960 --> 00:14:16.580
Overriding opposing voices,

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:19.500
Kongming left the defense of
a strategic point in Ma Su's hands.

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:20.830
But as a result,

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:23.750
their forces were unable to stave off the enemy
and they lost the battle.

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:25.330
Wait, what?

00:14:25.330 --> 00:14:27.460
You showed favoritism to your apprentice?

00:14:28.210 --> 00:14:29.500
Well?!

00:14:29.880 --> 00:14:32.210
Surely, the real Kongming could answer me.

00:14:33.210 --> 00:14:35.670
At the time, Shu was short on talented men,

00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:37.960
and we were in need of new regional officials.

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:41.500
Certainly some voices were pushing
for Wei Yan or Wu Yi,

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:44.380
but we would've never developed
successors following that path.

00:14:44.380 --> 00:14:46.460
The job was just to stop an advance,

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:48.670
so Ma Su should be easily able to handle it.

00:14:48.920 --> 00:14:50.540
That was my assessment.

00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:53.000
But it didn't work out that way.

00:14:53.210 --> 00:14:55.580
You put too much faith in Ma Su!

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:59.670
It seems Ma Su had a plan
involving assailing Chang'an.

00:15:00.130 --> 00:15:01.380
Thinking back now,

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:06.420
perhaps he allowed the enemy to pass
in order to press me to storm Chang'an.

00:15:06.540 --> 00:15:08.630
So rather than it being a failure he planned it?

00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:10.380
I do wonder...

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:13.250
Perhaps it is only what I want to believe.

00:15:13.460 --> 00:15:15.920
What's with you two?
What're you talking about?

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:17.710
Why're you crying?!

00:15:17.960 --> 00:15:19.830
Justice before generosity, tears be damned.

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:24.540
Kongming tearfully executed the defeated Ma Su
to preserve troop discipline.

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:26.290
Talk about strict!

00:15:26.290 --> 00:15:28.080
He was a precious man of talent.

00:15:28.080 --> 00:15:29.960
Indeed, that he was.

00:15:36.210 --> 00:15:38.170
This guy's totally Kongming!

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:39.540
The clothing is spot on, too!

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:41.960
I prefer plainer garb myself, though.

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:42.960
Owner?

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:46.380
I've wanted a worker to talk about
"Records of the Three Kingdoms" with.

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:48.920
None of the kids these days know about that stuff.

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:49.960
So, you're saying...

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:51.460
Yep, he's hired!

00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:52.500
Can you start today?

00:15:52.500 --> 00:15:53.630
At your service.

00:15:54.630 --> 00:15:57.170
I have Kongming serving under me at long last!

00:15:57.170 --> 00:15:59.080
Oh, right, stay dressed just like that!

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:00.580
Nothing would suit me better.

00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:02.170
Eiko, get him up to speed!

00:16:02.290 --> 00:16:04.080
It's almost time for us to open.

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:07.170
Hey, what happened to your eye patch?

00:16:07.630 --> 00:16:08.500
Well, yesterday was Halloween, so...

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:09.500
You looked like Xiahou Dun! It was great!
Well, yesterday was Halloween, so...<b></b>

00:16:09.500 --> 00:16:09.960
You looked like Xiahou Dun! It was great!

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:10.960
You looked like Xiahou Dun! It was great!
<i>That Three Kingdoms nerd...</i><b></b>

00:16:10.960 --> 00:16:11.580
<i>That Three Kingdoms nerd...</i>

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:15.500
First off, congrats are in order!

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:16.790
Thank you.

00:16:17.170 --> 00:16:19.540
It is all due to your assistance.

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:21.750
Yeah, that's it.

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:24.040
Just squeeze the lime there and it's all done.

00:16:30.290 --> 00:16:31.750
Another failure...

00:16:31.750 --> 00:16:32.750
Something wrong?

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:33.790
Oh, nothing!

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:37.210
Anyway, think you can remember the
cocktail recipes and prices?

00:16:37.210 --> 00:16:38.710
Yes, I'll manage.

00:16:38.710 --> 00:16:41.170
Well, just let me know if you have any questions.

00:16:41.500 --> 00:16:42.710
Thank you.

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:44.920
There is something I'd like to ask...

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:50.500
The song playing is quite a bit slower
than the music last night, isn't it?

00:16:50.710 --> 00:16:56.130
Ah, well after we open we play stuff
that's around 100 BPM for a while.

00:16:56.130 --> 00:16:57.750
What is "BPM"?

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:59.330
A song's tempo.

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:02.630
The music last night was between 130 and 160.

00:17:02.880 --> 00:17:04.830
Fast tempo songs get people pumped up, you know?

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:06.290
I see...

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:11.080
It's true that when Zhang Fei was throwing back liquor,
the onlookers' handclaps increased in pace.

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:13.210
You guys talking about the Three Kingdoms?!

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:19.040
Hey, is my drink ready?!

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:19.670
Yes!
Hey, is my drink ready?!<b></b>

00:17:19.670 --> 00:17:20.580
Hurry and ring me up.

00:17:20.580 --> 00:17:21.460
Coming!
Hurry and ring me up.<b></b>

00:17:21.460 --> 00:17:23.580
<i>We're super busy today.</i>

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:24.920
<i>I wonder if Kongming's doing all right?</i>

00:17:24.920 --> 00:17:27.080
Your gin tonic and daiquiri are ready.

00:17:27.080 --> 00:17:29.290
I have a martini and a Bacardi here.

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:30.670
Your salty dog and gin tonic are ready.

00:17:30.670 --> 00:17:32.290
That will be 1,700 yen with tax.

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:33.750
By card? Certainly, sir.

00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:36.130
This really your first time?

00:17:37.460 --> 00:17:39.420
This is easier than making tea.

00:17:39.420 --> 00:17:40.040
Beer, please!

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:40.880
Same here!
Beer, please!<b></b>

00:17:40.880 --> 00:17:41.540
Same here!
Screwdriver for me!<b></b>

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:42.710
Frozen daiquiri over here!
Screwdriver for me!<b></b>

00:17:42.710 --> 00:17:43.710
Certainly.

00:17:45.630 --> 00:17:46.750
Take care of the cocktails, please.

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:48.290
I'll handle the beer and register.

00:17:55.330 --> 00:17:56.880
Sorry about the wait!

00:17:58.540 --> 00:18:00.130
Eiko, I'll take over.

00:18:00.130 --> 00:18:01.750
Um, I'll be fine.

00:18:01.750 --> 00:18:02.960
Get up there and sing.

00:18:05.290 --> 00:18:06.290
Yes, sir!

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:08.880
One fuzzy navel, ple-

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:11.670
<b>Now what can you see with your eyes?</b>

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:15.960
<b>Sono shisen no saki ni (True faith)</b>

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:15.960
<b>Before that gaze (True faith)</b>

00:18:15.960 --> 00:18:23.000
<b>Donna unmei go egakareteiru no (True fate)</b>

00:18:15.960 --> 00:18:23.000
<b>What sort of fate is depicted? (True fate)</b>

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:20.080
<i>Eiko's songs truly are wonderful.</i>

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:22.920
It's such a waste...

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:25.750
<b>Let me see it, wow</b>

00:18:23.670 --> 00:18:26.080
I think Eiko would make it further at a major agency

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:27.330
than a club like this

00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:30.500
<b>Samenai yume no saki tooku</b>

00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:30.500
<b>Far beyond an unwaking dream</b>

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:30.290
that isn't known for singer-focused events.

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:32.880
<b>Let me see it, wow</b>

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:32.250
What do you mean by "major agency"?

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:34.170
Uh, like the Wei army.

00:18:34.170 --> 00:18:35.170
Ah, I see.

00:18:34.290 --> 00:18:36.880
<b>Dive into the new world</b>

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:38.790
Seems she really lets her guard down around you.

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:40.290
<b>Dreams come alive</b>

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:43.250
I won't pry, but know that that's rare for her.

00:18:40.290 --> 00:18:43.420
<b>Reach for the top</b>

00:18:43.670 --> 00:18:44.670
That said...

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:47.880
<b>Dreams will come true</b>

00:18:45.540 --> 00:18:48.210
don't you betray her if you know what's good for ya.

00:18:47.880 --> 00:18:50.580
<b>We'll find the lights</b>

00:18:52.540 --> 00:18:54.540
Whew, we're finally done!

00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:57.580
You gotta be tired after stepping into a job so suddenly.

00:18:57.920 --> 00:18:58.920
Not at all.

00:18:58.920 --> 00:19:02.710
After hearing your lovely singing,
my fatigue melted away.

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:06.710
I-I can't believe you can say that with a straight face.

00:19:06.710 --> 00:19:08.000
Aren't you embarrassed?

00:19:08.380 --> 00:19:09.580
I am happy to hear it, though.

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:12.500
Without ever expressing what was in their hearts...

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:16.500
...I saw many a man fall on the battlefield.

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:23.040
Frank opinions and honest sentiments
should be expressed while one is alive to do so.

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:24.500
That is my belief.

00:19:27.080 --> 00:19:29.580
So, what drew you to music?

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:35.710
I went through a lot in my high school years.

00:19:36.750 --> 00:19:39.330
I was in a bad place mentally,

00:19:39.330 --> 00:19:41.750
and when I came to Shibuya on a school trip...

00:19:46.380 --> 00:19:47.630
Damned kid...

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:52.130
We've got a special guest tonight,
so at least wait till after that before dyin'.

00:19:55.540 --> 00:19:57.290
The performance that night...

00:19:58.790 --> 00:20:00.670
The singer's voice...

00:20:02.630 --> 00:20:03.880
...shook me.

00:20:05.170 --> 00:20:08.750
I later learned she was a singer from America.

00:20:09.420 --> 00:20:12.380
I realized this was no time to die.

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:15.330
I wanted to move someone the way she moved me.

00:20:16.710 --> 00:20:17.710
But...

00:20:19.460 --> 00:20:22.210
I'm thinking of giving up on being a singer.

00:20:23.210 --> 00:20:27.750
I love singing and want to keep doing it,
but I keep on failing all my auditions.

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:30.210
I feel...

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:32.920
like I don't have any talent.

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:36.790
Honestly, I was thinking it's a good time to quit.

00:20:38.630 --> 00:20:41.540
Eiko, please have confidence in yourself.

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:47.130
You see, your music has offered salvation
to someone right in front of you.

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:49.040
Even so...

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:52.670
You have the power to convey your feelings to others.

00:20:52.920 --> 00:20:55.920
Perhaps others can't see it, but I am convinced.

00:20:56.420 --> 00:21:00.750
Besides, if you were to quit,
I am sure your fans would be sad.

00:21:00.750 --> 00:21:02.170
Like I have any fans.

00:21:02.170 --> 00:21:04.170
Do you not have one right here?

00:21:06.630 --> 00:21:07.630
Thrice...

00:21:07.960 --> 00:21:10.830
I have heard you sing three times now, Eiko.

00:21:11.210 --> 00:21:12.460
My heart trembled,

00:21:12.460 --> 00:21:16.830
and I thought,"I would like many more people
to be touched by this music."

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:18.920
Thrice I've been called on...

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:21.790
As a scholar who devours texts in his cottage,

00:21:21.790 --> 00:21:25.250
to not respond to a person of ambition
would make me dishonorable.

00:21:26.130 --> 00:21:30.080
Therefore, I shall be your tactician.

00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:34.880
Eiko, what is your dream?

00:21:35.210 --> 00:21:36.460
To debut as a professional singer?

00:21:36.460 --> 00:21:38.750
To gather an audience 10,000 strong?

00:21:39.460 --> 00:21:43.500
No matter what may come,
no matter how difficult the road,

00:21:43.500 --> 00:21:47.170
I, Kongming, will move heaven and earth to assist you.

00:21:47.580 --> 00:21:49.580
Command me at your will.

00:21:49.580 --> 00:21:53.080
In some small way, I wise to wish to tax my ingenuity.

00:21:53.460 --> 00:21:54.750
"Command," you say?

00:21:56.500 --> 00:21:58.040
You really are in character.

00:21:59.540 --> 00:22:01.540
But when you put it like that...

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:03.710
Jeez, you're not playing fair!

00:22:04.040 --> 00:22:07.210
You're making me want to do my best.

00:22:08.500 --> 00:22:10.080
I could ask for nothing better.

00:22:10.080 --> 00:22:11.000
<b>Hey DJ</b>

00:22:11.080 --> 00:22:14.880
<b>Do it, yeah yeah yeah, that superb-feeling</b>

00:22:14.880 --> 00:22:18.790
<b>Needle, drop it, blast the sound, party night</b>

00:22:18.790 --> 00:22:22.670
<b>Let's drink, alright alright alright, let's all dance!</b>

00:22:22.670 --> 00:22:28.960
<b>Hip-pop people, play that miracle number</b>

00:22:33.670 --> 00:22:36.080
<b>Yo! Music that we share in an era like this</b>

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:38.000
<b>We want to search for it, a globe that spins</b>

00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:39.960
<b>Wavering, unstable lives</b>

00:22:39.960 --> 00:22:41.790
<b>That's why we emphasize balance</b>

00:22:41.790 --> 00:22:44.080
<b>Not everything is great, so I can try my best!</b>

00:22:44.080 --> 00:22:45.670
<b>Kick the worst of days</b>

00:22:45.670 --> 00:22:47.540
<b>Click the restart button!</b>

00:22:47.540 --> 00:22:49.330
<b>DJ, play it! Now, trip</b>

00:22:49.330 --> 00:22:59.040
<b>Let's groove to the hip beat and shake our feeling bodies</b>

00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:04.880
<b>Hey DJ, butt in, yeah yeah yeah, that superb-feeling</b>

00:23:04.880 --> 00:23:08.710
<b>Wave, ride it and fly off, funky night</b>

00:23:08.710 --> 00:23:12.540
<b>Let's drink, alright alright alright, let's all dance!</b>

00:23:12.540 --> 00:23:20.040
<b>Hip-pop people, a miracle number until the morn</b>

00:23:23.210 --> 00:23:26.250
<b>Hey DJ, do it, yeah yeah yeah</b>

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:30.040
<b>Nomou, rai rai rai</b>

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:30.040
<b>Let's drink, alright alright alright</b>

00:23:30.920 --> 00:23:33.880
<b>Hey DJ, do it, yeah yeah yeah</b>

00:23:30.920 --> 00:23:33.880
<b>Hey DJ, kamase, yeah yeah yeah</b>

00:23:36.000 --> 00:23:40.960
<b>TUNE IN NEXT TIME</b>
